.TH ALI-RETRO 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-retro \- TempleOS tribute mode, 640x480 pilgrimage
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-retro on|off
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B on
saves the current mode, drops the primary display to 640x480 (or
the smallest mode) and opens a fullscreen white-on-navy terminal.
.B off
restores the saved mode. Amen.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-oracle (1)
